Z||000006||cadero2dmax||10-31-2001||11:11 PM||||I have been transporting Fieros and Fiero kit cars for several years now in a Pace enclosed trailer behind a Dodge 24v Cummins Turbo Diesel 5 speed. I charge .75 per loaded mile, but I operate out of Tulsa on weekends and extended weekends. <P>I could/would do your haul if I had a return trip, or one from this area to Ohio (or the maximum wish - - both!!) :-)<P>------------------<BR>G<BR>Daily Driver - <BR>85 SE<BR>4.9 Cad<BR>Isuzu 5 speed<BR>'88 cradle<BR>lowered 2 1/2"<BR>Mr. Mikes interior<P>GRM $2002 Challenge Fiero<BR>84 coupe<BR>4.9 (carburated)<BR>2.86:1 TH-125 w/shift kit||||reg||12
